      "variant_id": "B4-v001",
      "brief_id": "B4",
      "direction": "soft_pebble",
      "name": "Soft Pebble Recycled Air-Quality Detector",
      "form_language": "A slim, rounded pebble form with continuous convex surfaces and no hard edges, conveying a warm, honest, hand-friendly object. The front face is gently domed to host a flush display window and a diffuse intake field, while the sides taper to a thin, comfortable grip. The rear face is flat for stable placement and carries a large snap-fit seam, a tool-free clip release, and a recessed USB-C opening. All plastic parts are recycled ABS with a light texture, no paint, no coatings, and a mono-material construction.",
      "silhouette": "pebble",
      "envelope_mm": {
        "length": 122.0,
        "width": 72.0,
        "height": 28.0
      },
      "corner_radius_mm": 14.0,
      "display": {
        "face": "front",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 42.0
      },
      "display_window_mm": {
        "width": 46.0,
        "height": 21.0
      },
      "intake": {
        "face": "front",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 78.0
      },
      "usb": {
        "face": "right",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 50.0
      },
      "cmf": {
        "material": "rABS",
        "finish": "textured_light",
        "color": "natural warm grey with visible dark speckles",
        "secondary_ops": []
      },
      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Use only recycled ABS for every plastic part; no other polymers, no paint, no coatings, and no secondary decorative operations.",
          "category": "sustainability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Housing must be fully screw-free and openable with a single tool-free release clip, using snap-fit features designed for repeated disassembly and repair.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "Maintain the soft pebble silhouette with a minimum 14 mm corner radius and continuous convex surfaces, with no sharp edges or visible parting lines on the front face.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "Keep the front face layout: display window centred at 50% width and 42% height, intake field centred at 50% width and 78% height, both flush with the shell.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "The rABS colour must remain the natural warm grey with visible dark speckles; no added colourants or masterbatch that would compromise recyclability or increase cost.",
          "category": "cmf",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "The snap-fit and clip features must pass a 1 m drop test onto concrete and a 500-cycle disassembly test while preserving housing integrity.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "This concept adapts the DFM-safe reference by increasing corner radii to 14 mm and adopting a pebble silhouette, which distributes impact loads and reduces stress concentrations in recycled ABS. The mono-material rABS construction with a light texture and no secondary operations directly satisfies the sustainability brief while staying under the CNY 18 BOM ceiling. The front-mounted display and intake keep the user-facing interface simple, and the side USB-C allows flush charging. A single tool-free clip on the rear enables screw-free disassembly for repair and recycling. The envelope of 122 x 72 x 28 mm and an estimated mass of ~165 g stay within the 125 x 75 x 30 mm and 180 g limits. The speckled natural grey rABS delivers the honest, warm aesthetic without paint or coatings, and all design decisions prioritise recyclability, repairability, and durability."
    },
